        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml sequence-login\n!theme plain\ntitle Sequence Diagram - Login &amp; Wajib Ganti Password (Arsitektur MVC)\n\n/&#39; ====================================================================\nPENJELASAN SIMBOL SEQUENCE DIAGRAM\n1. Actor / Participant: aktor pengguna dan komponen sistem.\n2. Arsitektur MVC: lapisan View (antarmuka), Controller (pengendali),\n   dan Model (logika bisnis). Data memakai nama entitas langsung\n   (misalnya \&quot;user\&quot;), bukan istilah umum \&quot;database\&quot;.\n3. Life Line: garis putus-putus vertikal di bawah setiap partisipan.\n4. Activation: kotak vertikal yang menandai durasi proses berjalan.\n5. Message: panah penuh (-&amp;gt;) untuk aksi, panah putus (--&amp;gt;) untuk balasan.\n6. Recursive: pesan dari objek ke dirinya sendiri (logika internal).\n7. Alur mengikuti yang diakses user: Beranda -&amp;gt; Login -&amp;gt; Dashboard peran.\n==================================================================== &#39;/\n\nactor \&quot;Pengguna\&quot; as User\nparticipant \&quot;Beranda (View)\&quot; as Beranda\nparticipant \&quot;LoginPage (View)\&quot; as View\nparticipant \&quot;AuthController\&quot; as Ctrl\nparticipant \&quot;UserModel (Model)\&quot; as Model\nparticipant \&quot;user\&quot; as UserEnt\nparticipant \&quot;Dashboard (View)\&quot; as Dashboard\n\nUser -&amp;gt; Beranda : Buka aplikasi (beranda)\nactivate Beranda\nBeranda --&amp;gt; User : Halaman beranda tampil\ndeactivate Beranda\nUser -&amp;gt; View : Klik \&quot;Masuk\&quot; &amp; isi kredensial\nactivate View\nView -&amp;gt; Ctrl : Teruskan kredensial\nactivate Ctrl\nCtrl -&amp;gt; Model : Validasi &amp; otentikasi\nactivate Model\nModel -&amp;gt; UserEnt : Cari user (username)\nactivate UserEnt\nUserEnt -&amp;gt; UserEnt : Cek hash bcrypt\ndeactivate UserEnt\n\nalt Kredensial salah\n  UserEnt --&amp;gt; Model : user tidak cocok\n  deactivate Model\n  Model --&amp;gt; Ctrl : kredensial salah\n  deactivate Ctrl\n  Ctrl --&amp;gt; View : pesan kesalahan\n  View --&amp;gt; User : ID/Password salah\n  deactivate View\n\nelse Kredensial benar\n  UserEnt --&amp;gt; Model : user valid\n  deactivate Model\n  Ctrl -&amp;gt; Ctrl : Buat sesi httpOnly cookie\n\n  alt mustChangePassword = true\n    Ctrl --&amp;gt; View : Arahkan form ganti password\n    View --&amp;gt; User : minta password baru\n\n    User -&amp;gt; View : Isi password baru\n    activate View\n    View -&amp;gt; Ctrl : Set password baru\n    activate Ctrl\n    Ctrl -&amp;gt; Model : Hash &amp; simpan password\n    activate Model\n    Model -&amp;gt; UserEnt : Simpan hash baru di user\n    activate UserEnt\n    UserEnt --&amp;gt; Model : tersimpan\n    deactivate UserEnt\n    deactivate Model\n    deactivate Ctrl\n    deactivate View\n  end\n\n  Ctrl -&amp;gt; Dashboard : Arahkan ke dashboard sesuai peran\n  activate Dashboard\n  Dashboard -&amp;gt; Dashboard : Muat menu sesuai role\n  deactivate Dashboard\n  deactivate Ctrl\n  Dashboard --&amp;gt; User : Dashboard peran tampil\nend\n\n/*\n====================================================================\nLEGEND (keterangan gambar)\n====================================================================\n| Komponen | Keterangan |\n| Actor | Pengguna yang berinteraksi dengan sistem. |\n| Beranda (View) | Halaman landing yang pertama diakses user. |\n| View | Lapisan antarmuka (UI), misal LoginPage &amp; Dashboard. |\n| Controller | Pengendali alur permintaan (AuthController). |\n| Model | Logika bisnis &amp; validasi (UserModel). |\n| user | Entitas/data pengguna (tabel user). |\n| Life Line | Garis putus-putus di bawah partisipan. |\n| Activation | Kotak durasi operasi aktif. |\n| Panah Penuh (-&amp;gt;) | Pesan / pemanggilan aksi. |\n| Panah Putus (--&amp;gt;) | Pesan balasan (return). |\n| Panah Melengkung | Recursive: logika internal objek. |\n====================================================================\n*/\n\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="r1xjcwf">
